# CG-Agent Ollama Modelfile for a GGUF re-export of a fused MLX model.
#
# A fine-tuned MLX adapter cannot be attached here — Ollama cannot hot-load an
# MLX adapter. Fuse first, convert the fused model to GGUF (llama.cpp), then
# `ollama create cgagent-fused -f finetune/Modelfile.cgagent` after changing
# FROM to that GGUF file.
#
# This file does not ship a SYSTEM prompt. Persona and loopback contracts live
# in the harness (soul.md / planner prompts), not in Ollama. For the live-MLX
# path, serve the fused model with mlx_lm.server and point models.local_llm /
# agentic.deepagent_github at the loopback URL instead.
FROM qwen3.8:27b-mlx
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
